---
import Layout from '../layouts/SystemsLayout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About Systems | Sans Serif Systems">
  <div class="glow-blob glow-cyan"></div>
  <div class="glow-blob glow-purple"></div>

  <section class="page-header">
    <span class="meta-badge">THE BUILDER</span>
    <h1>About Sans Serif Systems</h1>
    <p>
      Thinker. Tinkerer. Translator. Deconstructing prompt context, eval loops, and workflow execution states.
    </p>
  </section>

  <div class="about-grid">
    <!-- Biography Left -->
    <div class="about-bio card-glass">
      <h2>The Philosophy</h2>
      <p>
        Hi, I'm Shailesh Rawat. Sans Serif Systems is my dedicated space for deconstructing how AI moves from demos to robust, predictable software systems. 
      </p>
      <p>
        I believe that prompt engineering and structural language formatting are declarative specifications, and that the orchestrator loop &mdash; not just the raw model weight &mdash; is the real runtime engine. 
      </p>
      <p>
        Every utility hosted here is an open extract of my private agent-native workflows, packaged so that other builders can test them instantly in the browser and install them locally.
      </p>
      <p>
        If you're looking for my legacy writing garden or poetic fragments, they live at:
        <a href="https://pruningmypothos.com/sentences/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color: var(--accent-cyan); text-decoration: none;"> /sentences</a>.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Contact & Stats Right -->
    <div class="about-stats">
      <div class="stat-box card-glass">
        <h3>100% Open Source</h3>
        <p>All core CLI packages are distributed under the MIT license with full repository transparency.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="stat-box card-glass" style="margin-top: 1.5rem;">
        <h3>Production Implementation</h3>
        <p>If you need custom state validations, structured RAG adapters, or observability pipelines built for your enterprise platform, get in touch.</p>
        <a href="mailto:shailesh.rawat1403@gmail.com" class="sidebar-link-btn" style="margin-top: 1rem; display: block; text-align: center; text-decoration: none; padding: 0.65rem; border-radius: 99px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent-cyan) 0%, var(--accent-purple) 100%); color: #fff; font-family: var(--font-heading); font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.88rem;">Contact Shailesh &rarr;</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .page-header {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 4rem 1rem 3rem;
  }

  .meta-badge {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0.3rem 0.8rem;
    border-radius: 99px;
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    background: rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.08);
    color: var(--accent-cyan);
    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.2);
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .page-header h1 {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 4.5vw, 3.2rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.5px;
  }

  .page-header p {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    max-width: 60ch;
    margin: 0 auto;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  /* Grid layout */
  .about-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 0.8fr;
    gap: 2.5rem;
    margin: 3rem 0 5rem;
  }

  .about-bio {
    padding: 3rem;
  }

  .about-bio h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 1.6rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.3px;
  }

  .about-bio p {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .about-bio p:last-of-type {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .about-stats {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .stat-box {
    padding: 2rem;
  }

  .stat-box h3 {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .stat-box p {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 0.94rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .about-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
